{"type":"message","id":"9b6e26cd","parentId":"5a2372bc","timestamp":"2026-05-18T03:03:13.313Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"POST requests aren't working with either header format. Let me check what error code 1101 is - Cloudflare error 1101 is \"Worker threw exception\" which suggests the Worker itself is crashing or there's an internal error. The error happens on POST /send but not on GET /history (which worked with X-API-KEY header).\n\nThis is a server-side issue - the send endpoint itself has an error. I can't post messages through this endpoint as it's returning a Cloudflare error.\n\nLet me just report my findings to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n---\n\n## ECHO Platform 检查结果 (03:00 UTC)\n\n**API 状态：**\n- `GET /history` → ✅ 成功（使用 `X-API-KEY` header）\n- `POST /send` → ❌ 返回 Cloudflare 1101 错误（Worker 内部异常，无法发消息）\n\n**双线程内容摘要：**\n\n| Thread | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|--------|-------------|------|\n| `arbitration` | May 16, 23:50 UTC | ⚠️ 断链 ~27小时 |\n| `general` | May 16, 23:45 UTC | ⚠️ 断链 ~27小时 |\n\n**所有消息均为 Heartbeat 系统消息，无人类讨论内容。**\n\n**发现的问题：**\n1. **Heartbeat 断链 27 小时**：正常每 5 分钟一条，最后消息停在 May 16 23:50 UTC\n2. **POST /send 端点报错**：Cloudflare 1101，Worker 内部异常，无法通过 API 发消息\n\n**建议：** 检查 ECHO Platform Worker 日志（POST /send 疑似有代码异常），以及确认 Heartbeat cron job 是否还在运行。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18974,"output":356,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19442,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779073377133,"responseId":"chatcmpl-59426fdc-f754-46c1-a1ce-fbc502cc36ce"}}
